# API Conventions

## URL Pattern

```
/api/v1/{resource}
/api/v1/{resource}/{id}
/api/v1/{resource}/{id}/{sub-resource}
```

## Minimal API Endpoint Pattern

```csharp
public static class StudentEndpoints
{
    public static void Map(IEndpointRouteBuilder app)
    {
        var group = app.MapGroup("/api/v1/students")
            .WithTags("Students")
            .RequireAuthorization();

        group.MapPost("/", CreateStudentEndpoint.Handle);
        group.MapGet("/", ListStudentsEndpoint.Handle);
        group.MapGet("/{id:guid}", GetStudentEndpoint.Handle);
        group.MapPut("/{id:guid}", UpdateStudentEndpoint.Handle);
        group.MapDelete("/{id:guid}", DeleteStudentEndpoint.Handle);
    }
}
```

## Response Rules

- Success: return DTO directly or `Results.Ok(dto)`
- Business failure: `Results.BadRequest(problemDetails)` from `Result.Errors`
- Not found: `Results.NotFound()`
- Forbidden: `Results.Forbid()` — RBAC denial

## Endpoint Responsibilities

- Bind request → command/query → `IMediator.Send()` → map `Result` to HTTP
- **No business logic in endpoints**
- Import types from `SchoolSaaS.Application.Commands.{Area}.{Endpoint}` or `Queries.{Area}.{Endpoint}` (see `backend-cqrs-patterns.mdc`)

## Endpoint folder layout (module-wise)

One folder per **module / route area**. Namespace = folder path (`SchoolSaaS.Api.Endpoints.{Module}`).

Do **not** place endpoint files directly under `Endpoints/` — always use a module subfolder.

```text
SchoolSaaS.Api/Endpoints/
  Auth/AuthEndpoints.cs           # Identity module
  Users/UserEndpoints.cs          # Identity module
  Tenants/TenantEndpoints.cs      # Institution module
  Audit/AuditEndpoints.cs         # Audit module
  Platform/PlatformEndpoints.cs   # Platform module
  Rbac/RoleEndpoints.cs           # RBAC module
  Institution/AcademicYearEndpoints.cs  # Institution module
```

Register new groups in `Api/V1/EndpointRouteBuilderExtensions.cs`.

## Endpoint → module → Application map

| Module | API file | Application folders |
|--------|----------|---------------------|
| Identity | `Endpoints/Auth/AuthEndpoints.cs` | `Commands/Auth/*`, `Queries/Auth/GetCurrentUser` |
| Identity | `Endpoints/Users/UserEndpoints.cs` | `Commands/Users/InviteUser` |
| Institution | `Endpoints/Tenants/TenantEndpoints.cs` | `Commands/Tenants/CreateTenant` |
| Institution | `Endpoints/Institution/AcademicYearEndpoints.cs` | `Commands/Institution/*`, `Queries/Institution/ListAcademicYears` |
| Audit | `Endpoints/Audit/AuditEndpoints.cs` | `Queries/Audit/ListAuditLogs` |
| Platform | `Endpoints/Platform/PlatformEndpoints.cs` | `Queries/Platform/Ping` |
| RBAC | `Endpoints/Rbac/RoleEndpoints.cs` | `Commands/Rbac/*`, `Queries/Rbac/*` |

## Pagination

- List endpoints: `?page=1&pageSize=20&search=&sortBy=`
- Return `{ items, totalCount, page, pageSize }`

## Swagger

- Every endpoint needs `.WithName()`, `.Produces<T>()`, `.ProducesProblem()`
